Z||000000||FieroPerformance||09-05-2001||07:36 PM||||I have an 85 GT that has a 5 spd. swapped into it. Right now the craddle assembly is out of the car. I am planning on taking the tranny to a shop to have it worked on (I am starting to hear grinding when I shift hard/fast into 3rd, 4th and 5th). Anyway, I am pretty sure that it is an Isuzu. Is there any way to tell by looking at it to know for sure? I haven't been able to find any serial number or brand name but it might be because it is dirty and I can't see it. Where should I look?<P>BTW: What should my throttle body say (brand name ect.) on the top?<P>Thanks,<BR>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by FieroPerformance (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||1
