Z||000002||HummelHund||09-05-2001||10:58 PM||||The throttle body should have "Holley" in raised letters on top of it.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project/daily driver)<BR>'84 SE (Dad's Project)||||reg||1
Z||000003||StuGood||09-06-2001||10:26 AM||||My favorite way to identify a Getrag-Muncie 5-speed:  The end plate (furthest from the bellhousing end) is steel, on a Getrag.  Mr. Magnet will tell you what you've got. ||||reg||1
